---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — Roofero"
  description="Read Roofero's privacy policy to understand how we protect and manage your personal data."
>
  <main class="page-wrapper">
    <section class="max-w-[800px] mx-auto section-wrapper text-left">
      <span
        class="text-foreground font-heading text-base font-semibold border-b border-foreground pb-1 inline-block mb-8"
      >
        Legal
      </span>
      <h1 class="text-foreground font-heading font-medium tracking-tight mb-8">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground body-text mb-8">
        Last updated: May 24, 2026
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-8 font-sans text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-foreground font-heading text-2xl font-semibold">
            1. Introduction
          </h2>
          <p>
            Welcome to Roofero ("we", "our", or "us"). We are committed to
            protecting your personal information and your right to privacy. This
            Privacy Policy governs our privacy practices regarding the services
            we provide, including our website and any other interactions you
            have with us.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-foreground font-heading text-2xl font-semibold">
            2. Information We Collect
          </h2>
          <p>
            We collect personal information that you voluntarily provide to us
            when you fill out contact forms, request estimates, or subscribe to
            our newsletter. This information may include:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
            <li>
              Name and contact details (email address, phone number, mailing
              address).
            </li>
            <li>
              Property information relevant to roofing or solar estimate
              requests.
            </li>
            <li>Any other communication details you provide.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-foreground font-heading text-2xl font-semibold">
            3. How We Use Your Information
          </h2>
          <p>
            We use your personal information to process service request
            estimates, contact you regarding roofing and solar inspections, send
            newsletter updates if subscribed, and improve our website experience
            and safety protocols.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-4">
          <h2 class="text-foreground font-heading text-2xl font-semibold">
            4. Data Protection & Safety
          </h2>
          <p>
            We implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to
            maintain the security of your personal information. We do not sell
            or trade your data to third parties for marketing purposes.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
